          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            In fundamental physics, notably in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theory"} quantum field theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            one often says that a non-trivial
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence"} equivalence
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theories"} quantum field theories
            between two
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/models+%28in+theoretical+physics%29"} models (in theoretical physics)
            is a “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality"}> duality
            ”.
