          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %ul
            %li#AlvarezGaume98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Alvarez-Gaum%C3%A9"}> Luis Alvarez-Gaumé
                , Frederic Zamora:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality in Quantum Field Theory (and String Theory)
                %strong 423
                (1998) 46–83 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9709180"}> arXiv:hep-th/9709180
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011"} doi:10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011
            %li#Corfield17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Corfield"}> David Corfield
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality as a category-theoretic concept
                %strong 59
                (2017) 55-61 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.07.004"}> doi:10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.07.004
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sebastian+De+Haro"}> Sebastian De Haro
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Butterfield"} Jeremy Butterfield
              %p
                %em> The Philosophy and Physics of Duality
                , Cambridge University Press (2025) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.01616"}> arXiv:2508.01616
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/the-philosophy-and-physics-of-duality-9780198846338"} ISBN:9780198846338
          %h3#as_morita_equivalence As Morita equivalence
          %p
            On the idea that duality in physics may be captured by the notion of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morita+equivalence"} Morita equivalence
          %ul
            %li#Schwarz98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Albert+Schwarz"}> Albert Schwarz
                ,
                %em Morita equivalence and duality
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9805034"}> arXiv:hep-th/9805034
                )
            %li#Pioline99
              %p
                B. Pioline,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Albert+Schwarz"} Albert Schwarz
                %em
                  Morita equivalence and T-duality (or
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi B
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B
                  versus
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi Θ
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Theta
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9908019"}> arXiv:hep-th/9908019
                )
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li#Schwarz04
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Albert+Schwarz"}> Albert Schwarz
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em My Life In Science
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.math.ucdavis.edu/~schwarz/bion.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/AlbertSchwarzLifeInScience.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Specifically concerning
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/T-duality"} T-duality
          %ul
            %li#CNS11
              %p
                Ee Chang-Young, Hiroaki Nakajima, Hyeonjoon Shin,
                %em Fermionic T-duality and Morita Equivalence
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1101.0473"}> arXiv:1101.0473
                )
            %li#BMRS08
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacek+Brodzki"}> Jacek Brodzki
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Varghese+Mathai"} Varghese Mathai
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Rosenberg"} Jonathan Rosenberg
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Szabo"} Richard Szabo
                = succeed "," do
                  %em D-branes, KK-theory and duality on noncommutative spaces
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://eprints.soton.ac.uk/46524/1/D-branes,_KK-theory_and__duality_on_noncommutative_spaces_BRMS_Published_JoP.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Specifically concerning
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mirror+symmetry"} mirror symmetry
          %ul
            %li#Okada09
              So Okada,
              %em Homological mirror symmetry of Fermat polynomials
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0910.2014"}> arXiv:0910.2014
              )
          %p
            See also more general discussion of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morita+equivalence"} Morita equivalence
          %ul
            %li#BZBJ15
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Ben-Zvi"}> David Ben-Zvi
                , Adrien Brochier, David Jordan,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Integrating quantum groups over surfaces: quantum character varieties and topological field theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1501.04652"} arXiv:1501.04652
            %li#MW10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Scott+Morrison"}> Scott Morrison
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kevin+Walker"} Kevin Walker
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The blob complex
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1009.5025"} arXiv:1009.5025
            %li#Scheimbauer
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Claudia+Scheimbauer"}> Claudia Scheimbauer
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Factorization Homology as a Fully Extended Topological Field Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://math.unice.fr/~cazanave/Gdt/FH/ScheimbauerThesisJuly4FINAL.pdf"} pdf
          %h3#duality_in_string_theory Duality in string theory
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality+in+string+theory"} duality in string theory
            (but see there fore more):
          %ul
            %li#Polchinski14
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Joseph+Polchinski"}> Joseph Polchinski
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Dualities of Fields and Strings
              %p
                %strong 59
                (2017) 6-20 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1412.5704"}> arXiv:1412.5704
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011"} doi:10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"}> Cumrun Vafa
                , around 3:30, 12:00 of
                %em On Mathematical Aspects of String Theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yreUdrIbt2Q"}> video
                )
